# Crates the elevated helper may use at build time (its direct build
# dependencies, all four release targets). `cargo xtask helper-deps` fails when
# the helper has a build dependency that is not listed here.
#
# Build dependencies run while the helper is compiled. Nothing of them is
# linked into the program except what they write, so they are not in
# helper-deps.allow. Code that runs in the build of a program that runs with
# administrator rights is reviewed all the same, so every entry needs a
# maintainer's explicit approval and a reason here.

embed-resource  # Windows only: compiles the icon, version information and application manifest (requireAdministrator) into bytescape-helper.exe. On Linux its build script does nothing.
